# Copy to .env for development only; the packaged app reads nothing from it. No vendor keys here:
# hearing and rewriting happen on our server (subxvoice-api), which holds them.
#
# Leave both empty to use the live server and sign in with a real account. To work against a
# server on this machine instead (subxvoice-api on port 8080), set both: the dev token signs the
# app in as a local test account and must match the server's DEV_AUTH format.
SUBX_API_URL=
SUBX_DEV_TOKEN=
